      "status": null,
      "properties": {
        "distinction": "two \"filters\" must not be conflated. The **runtime pattern subscription** is this bus primitive (transport-side, hierarchy-aware prefix). The **authoring keyword/substring filter** \u2014 the Flow-mode search box (\"find anything containing `fuel`\") \u2014 is a *Composer tool* convenience that filters the *display* of observed namespaces (client-side); it is NOT a bus subscription and carries no transport cost. Arbitrary substring search belongs there; the bus primitive stays prefix-only.",
